I have uploaded the source to gwm (the Generic Window Manager) to
sunsite.unc.edu. It is in the pub/Linux/X11/Incoming directory, and
the file is called gwmlinux.taz.  Unpack it in the /usr/X386/lib/X11
directory.
  This version contains several patches against the original source,
as well as Olaf Kirch's flex-compatible replacement for wool.lex.  You
